<title>ITALY: De Rigo gains Police US distribution rights.</title>
<headline>De Rigo gains Police US distribution rights.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian spectacles and sunglasses maker De Rigo said it had acquired the direct control of the distribution of its Police brand of glasses in the U.S.</p>
<p>In addition, the group said in a statement it had reached an agreement for the production and distribution of glasses under licence for Sierra Club. The collection Sierra Club will be distributed exclusively by De Rigo in the U.S. and Canada.</p>
<p>De Rigo, based in northeastern Italy, has it shares listed in New York.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
